I'm excited for you all to graduate.

00:00:16.840 --> 00:00:17.520
And I'm excited for

00:00:17.520 --> 00:00:22.340
the first year to make it to the second
year, and it's just wonderful to be here.

00:00:22.340 --> 00:00:26.868
I will tell you that in the 14 years I've
been teaching here, the faculty, I think,

00:00:26.868 --> 00:00:31.228
has been pretty much the same, and the
students just are getting more impressive.

00:00:31.228 --> 00:00:35.583
All right, so you really are the best,
and my guess is that 10 years from now,

00:00:35.583 --> 00:00:38.382
the students will be even stronger.

00:00:38.382 --> 00:00:43.380
That's extraordinary, the statement
