00:00:43.380 --> 00:00:47.260
What I wanted to do was talk for a few
minutes about the age that we're in and

00:00:47.260 --> 00:00:49.050
the age we're going to.

00:00:49.050 --> 00:00:51.715
And then I thought,
since I've been here so long and

00:00:51.715 --> 00:00:55.592
because we talk a lot about these things,
talk a little bit about sort of life

00:00:55.592 --> 00:00:58.462
advice, some of things that
we talk about in our class.

00:00:58.462 --> 00:01:03.099
And maybe you can debate and disagree or
agree on this or anything else, or,

00:01:03.099 --> 00:01:05.997
perhaps, present your
latest startup idea and

00:01:05.997 --> 00:01:08.548
see how well you do in
front of your peers.

00:01:08.548 --> 00:01:13.650
I'm convinced that we're actually
entering an age of abundance,

00:01:13.650 --> 00:01:19.560
and that age of abundance is defined
by too much information, right?

00:01:19.560 --> 00:01:21.400
The first thing was turn
off your Twitter feed so

00:01:21.400 --> 00:01:23.150
that you could actually
focus on something.

00:01:25.200 --> 00:01:29.248
Whenever people say, turn off your phone,
I always say, don't turn off your phone,

00:01:29.248 --> 00:01:31.533
we're in the phone business,
you get the idea.

00:01:31.533 --> 00:01:33.416
We clearly have too much food, right,

00:01:33.416 --> 00:01:36.841
the world is not only capable of
feeding itself, but in fact obesity and

00:01:36.841 --> 00:01:40.862
weight gain, and so forth are becoming
major healthcare issues around the world.

00:01:40.862 --> 00:01:42.922
There are startups and

00:01:42.922 --> 00:01:48.659
industrial processes that will solve many
of the housing problems we have worldwide,

00:01:48.659 --> 00:01:51.590
and we're going to have abundant housing,
of relatively high quality.

00:01:51.590 --> 00:01:55.370
And it looks like we're going to have
pretty ubiquitous transportation,

00:01:55.370 --> 00:01:57.550
as a service, high quality also, as well.

00:01:58.570 --> 00:02:01.148
So a lot of the things
that we've talked about,

00:02:01.148 --> 00:02:04.247
as we arrive in this age of abundance,
