00:02:18.760 --> 00:02:22.860
technology optimist, we haven't been
able to quite fix those problems yet.

00:02:25.120 --> 00:02:27.960
People, too much in others' worlds,
too much regulation,

00:02:27.960 --> 00:02:31.140
too much anxiety,
a loss of egalitarianism.

00:02:32.605 --> 00:02:38.057
We've sort of forgotten the benefits
