00:03:17.860 --> 00:03:21.277
The principles that I've been operating
under, which I would encourage you to

00:03:21.277 --> 00:03:24.442
operate under, are personal freedom and
economic freedom, all right.

00:03:24.442 --> 00:03:28.302
And if you look at the history of the
